{"id":"rede","lemma":"rede","pos":"noun","rank":1095,"glosses":["net (mesh behind the goal frame)","hairnet (netting worn over one's hair)","sieve (something that catches and filters everything)"],"ipa":"/ˈʁe.dɨ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"redes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f2/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Nelson_Ricardo_2500-rede.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ele consertou a rede.","en":"He fixed the net.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to fix, to repair","l":"consertar"},{"g":"the / to"},null]},{"text":"Tom balançou as redes.","en":"Tom scored a goal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/537276","words":[{"g":"tone"},null,{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Tom pega borboletas com uma rede.","en":"Tom catches butterflies with a net.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to grab, hold","l":"pegar"},{"g":"butterfly, moth","l":"borboleta"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},null]},{"text":"Você tem conta em alguma rede social?","en":"Do you have any social media accounts?","words":[{"g":"you (formal)"},{"g":"has / there is","l":"ter"},{"g":"bill, check"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"some, any","l":"algum"},null,{"g":"social"}]},{"text":"Hoje em dia se fala muito em redes sociais.","en":"People talk a lot about social networks these days.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"if / oneself"},{"g":"speech"},{"g":"very / a lot"},{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"social","l":"social"}],"phrases":[[0,3,"nowadays"]]}]}